<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.6199 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.6199 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.6199 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Friday after 75.6000 on Thursday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Feb 28		  Feb 27</p>
<p> High			     75.5600		 75.5600</p>
<p> Low				75.7500		 75.7300</p>
<p> Open			     75.7500		 75.7000</p>
<p> Close			    75.6199		 75.6000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  2.185		   2.965</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 Feb 28		  Feb 27</p>
<p> High			     45.0200		 44.7500</p>
<p> Low				45.1000		 45.0000</p>
<p> Open			     45.1000		 44.7500</p>
<p> Close			    45.0500		 45.5000</p>
<p> Volume (DM million)		 0.025		   0.100</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
